<TR><TD CELLPADDING="0"><TABLE BORDER="0" CELLBORDER="0" CELLSPACING="0" CELLPADDING="0" WIDTH="1020"><TR><TD PORT="n1" STYLE="rounded" BGCOLOR="white" BORDER="1" COLOR="#E79AA6" CELLPADDING="7" VALIGN="TOP" ALIGN="LEFT" BALIGN="LEFT" WIDTH="222"><FONT POINT-SIZE="9" COLOR="#C8102E"><B>①</B></FONT><FONT POINT-SIZE="9" COLOR="#8A8F98"><I>   pp. 29, 36–38</I></FONT><BR ALIGN="LEFT"/><FONT POINT-SIZE="13" COLOR="#C8102E"><B>Necesidades internas de</B></FONT><BR ALIGN="LEFT"/><FONT POINT-SIZE="13" COLOR="#C8102E"><B>China</B></FONT><BR ALIGN="LEFT"/><FONT POINT-SIZE="3"> </FONT><BR ALIGN="LEFT"/><FONT POINT-SIZE="11.5" COLOR="#262A31">• Sobrecapacidad (acero, cemento,<BR ALIGN="LEFT"/>&#160;&#160;&#160;aluminio), sobreinversión y<BR ALIGN="LEFT"/>&#160;&#160;&#160;capital acumulado sin destino.</FONT><BR ALIGN="LEFT"/></TD><TD WIDTH="41" VALIGN="MIDDLE"><FONT POINT-SIZE="17" COLOR="#C8102E">→</FONT><BR/><FONT POINT-SIZE="8" COLOR="#C8102E"><I>exporta</I></FONT></TD><TD PORT="n2" STYLE="rounded" BGCOLOR="white" BORDER="1" COLOR="#E79AA6" CELLPADDING="7" VALIGN="TOP" ALIGN="LEFT" BALIGN="LEFT" WIDTH="222"><FONT POINT-SIZE="9" COLOR="#C8102E"><B>②</B></FONT><FONT POINT-SIZE="9" COLOR="#8A8F98"><I>   pp. 31, 40–42</I></FONT><BR ALIGN="LEFT"/><FONT POINT-SIZE="13" COLOR="#C8102E"><B>Financiamiento</B></FONT><BR ALIGN="LEFT"/><FONT POINT-SIZE="3"> </FONT><BR ALIGN="LEFT"/><FONT POINT-SIZE="11.5" COLOR="#262A31">• AIIB, Banco BRICS y Fondo de la<BR ALIGN="LEFT"/>&#160;&#160;&#160;Ruta de la Seda:<BR ALIGN="LEFT"/>&#160;&#160;&#160;«minilateralismo» financiero.</FONT><BR ALIGN="LEFT"/></TD><TD WIDTH="50" VALIGN="MIDDLE"><FONT POINT-SIZE="17" COLOR="#C8102E">→</FONT><BR/><FONT POINT-SIZE="8" COLOR="#C8102E"><I>construye</I></FONT></TD><TD PORT="n3" STYLE="rounded" BGCOLOR="white" BORDER="1" COLOR="#E79AA6" CELLPADDING="7" VALIGN="TOP" ALIGN="LEFT" BALIGN="LEFT" WIDTH="222"><FONT POINT-SIZE="9" COLOR="#C8102E"><B>③</B></FONT><FONT POINT-SIZE="9" COLOR="#8A8F98"><I>   pp. 38, 46</I></FONT><BR ALIGN="LEFT"/><FONT POINT-SIZE="13" COLOR="#C8102E"><B>Infraestructura</B></FONT><BR ALIGN="LEFT"/><FONT POINT-SIZE="3"> </FONT><BR ALIGN="LEFT"/><FONT POINT-SIZE="11.5" COLOR="#262A31">• Ferrocarriles, puertos,<BR ALIGN="LEFT"/>&#160;&#160;&#160;carreteras, hubs y parques<BR ALIGN="LEFT"/>&#160;&#160;&#160;industriales: una «invitación».</FONT><BR ALIGN="LEFT"/></TD><TD WIDTH="41" VALIGN="MIDDLE"><FONT POINT-SIZE="17" COLOR="#C8102E">→</FONT><BR/><FONT POINT-SIZE="8" COLOR="#C8102E"><I>produce</I></FONT></TD><TD PORT="n4" STYLE="rounded" BGCOLOR="white" BORDER="1" COLOR="#E79AA6" CELLPADDING="7" VALIGN="TOP" ALIGN="LEFT" BALIGN="LEFT" WIDTH="222"><FONT POINT-SIZE="9" COLOR="#C8102E"><B>④</B></FONT><FONT POINT-SIZE="9" COLOR="#8A8F98"><I>   pp. 45–46, 51</I></FONT><BR ALIGN="LEFT"/><FONT POINT-SIZE="13" COLOR="#C8102E"><B>Efectos en el país receptor</B></FONT><BR ALIGN="LEFT"/><FONT POINT-SIZE="3"> </FONT><BR ALIGN="LEFT"/><FONT POINT-SIZE="11.5" COLOR="#262A31">• ¿Más margen de maniobra y<BR ALIGN="LEFT"/>&#160;&#160;&#160;movilidad ascendente, o una nueva<BR ALIGN="LEFT"/>&#160;&#160;&#160;periferia?</FONT><BR ALIGN="LEFT"/></TD></TR></TABLE></TD></TR>
<TR><TD HEIGHT="11"> </TD></TR></TABLE>>];
