  b3r2 [label=<<TABLE BORDER="0" CELLBORDER="0" CELLSPACING="0" CELLPADDING="0" WIDTH="501.0" HEIGHT="87"><TR><TD PORT="L" WIDTH="1" HEIGHT="1" FIXEDSIZE="TRUE"></TD><TD PORT="inv" STYLE="rounded" BGCOLOR="white" BORDER="1" COLOR="#93C9CF" CELLPADDING="7" VALIGN="TOP" ALIGN="LEFT" BALIGN="LEFT" WIDTH="142"><FONT POINT-SIZE="9" COLOR="#0E6A75"><B>EXTERNO</B></FONT><FONT POINT-SIZE="9" COLOR="#8A8F98"><I>   p. 46 · n. 9</I></FONT><BR ALIGN="LEFT"/><FONT POINT-SIZE="13" COLOR="#0E6A75"><B>Promoción por</B></FONT><BR ALIGN="LEFT"/><FONT POINT-SIZE="13" COLOR="#0E6A75"><B>invitación</B></FONT><BR ALIGN="LEFT"/><FONT POINT-SIZE="3"> </FONT><BR ALIGN="LEFT"/><FONT POINT-SIZE="11.5" COLOR="#262A31">• El centro abre<BR ALIGN="LEFT"/>&#160;&#160;&#160;condiciones por su<BR ALIGN="LEFT"/>&#160;&#160;&#160;propio interés.</FONT><BR ALIGN="LEFT"/></TD><TD WIDTH="18" VALIGN="MIDDLE"><FONT POINT-SIZE="17" COLOR="#0E6A75">+</FONT></TD><TD PORT="sei" STYLE="rounded" BGCOLOR="white" BORDER="1" COLOR="#93C9CF" CELLPADDING="7" VALIGN="TOP" ALIGN="LEFT" BALIGN="LEFT" WIDTH="142"><FONT POINT-SIZE="9" COLOR="#0E6A75"><B>INTERNO</B></FONT><FONT POINT-SIZE="9" COLOR="#8A8F98"><I>   p. 46</I></FONT><BR ALIGN="LEFT"/><FONT POINT-SIZE="13" COLOR="#0E6A75"><B>Aprovechar la</B></FONT><BR ALIGN="LEFT"/><FONT POINT-SIZE="13" COLOR="#0E6A75"><B>oportunidad</B></FONT><BR ALIGN="LEFT"/><FONT POINT-SIZE="3"> </FONT><BR ALIGN="LEFT"/><FONT POINT-SIZE="11.5" COLOR="#262A31">• Capacidad propia de<BR ALIGN="LEFT"/>&#160;&#160;&#160;ajustarse y usarla.</FONT><BR ALIGN="LEFT"/></TD><TD WIDTH="18" VALIGN="MIDDLE"><FONT POINT-SIZE="17" COLOR="#0E6A75">=</FONT></TD><TD PORT="mob" STYLE="rounded" BGCOLOR="white" BORDER="1" COLOR="#93C9CF" CELLPADDING="7" VALIGN="TOP" ALIGN="LEFT" BALIGN="LEFT" WIDTH="179.0"><FONT POINT-SIZE="9" COLOR="#0E6A75"><B>③</B></FONT><FONT POINT-SIZE="9" COLOR="#8A8F98"><I>   pp. 32, 46</I></FONT><BR ALIGN="LEFT"/><FONT POINT-SIZE="13" COLOR="#C8102E"><B>Movilidad ascendente y</B></FONT